/E (The Gamified Financial Visualizer adopts a client-server model enhanced by event-driven architecture \(EDA\) to deliver a secure, engaging, and scalable platform for financial learning and management. This approach supports both functional goals and long-term growth through modular, reactive design. Key architectural principles are grounded in the following business needs:)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
